#! ia 1.0

@system design-base-system
  provider "local"
  version "0.1.0"
  describes "The public base atomic design and pattern-lowering system (inventarch/ia-design-base-kit). It mints six words without colliding with floor @template: design-token, one primitive, semantic or component token; level, one ranked atomic design stage (atom, molecule, organism, page-template, page); part, one UI component part at an atomic level with optional composition, slots, semantic tokens, Figma component-set names and code export; slot, one named composition slot on a part; pattern, one structural arrangement of design nodes yielding a part or level with frame-reading evidence; and recipe, one lowering of a part to code by use, adapt, compose or define using semantic or component tokens only. It carries authoring guides, atomic hierarchy and semantic-token laws, and the offline check-design-patterns verifier. It holds no proprietary design playbooks and grants no host authority."
  steward @agent design-base-system-steward
  requires
    - agent-system
    - compliance-system
    - governance-system
    - work-system
    - workspace-system
  discriminators
    design-token lowers to definition
      category state
      facets [design-token]
      schema @schema design-token
      artifact-set product-definition
      primitive Attention
      move Observation
    level lowers to definition
      category boundary
      facets [level]
      schema @schema level
      artifact-set product-definition
      primitive Attention
      move Observation
    part lowers to definition
      category boundary
      facets [part]
      schema @schema part
      artifact-set product-definition
      primitive Attention
      move Observation
    slot lowers to definition
      category boundary
      facets [slot]
      schema @schema slot
      artifact-set product-definition
      primitive Attention
      move Observation
    pattern lowers to definition
      category representation
      facets [pattern]
      schema @schema pattern
      artifact-set product-definition
      primitive Attention
      move Observation
    recipe lowers to definition
      category representation
      facets [recipe]
      schema @schema recipe
      artifact-set product-definition
      primitive Attention
      move Observation
  edges
    cite * using design-token, level, part, slot, pattern, recipe
    cite design-token, level, part, slot, pattern, recipe using *
    require design-token using design-token, part, recipe
    require level using level, part, slot, pattern
    require part using part, slot, pattern, recipe
    require slot using part, pattern, recipe
    require pattern using pattern, recipe
    require decision using part, pattern, recipe
    ground spec, plan, task using pattern, recipe
    supersede design-token using design-token
    supersede part using part
    supersede pattern using pattern
    supersede recipe using recipe
    govern design-token, level, part, slot, pattern, recipe using law, convention

@agent design-base-system-steward
  meaning
    says "Accountable owner of design-base-system vocabulary, canonical schemas, authoring guidance, relationship consent, atomic composition rules and offline design-pattern check."
    answers "Who owns the design-token, level, part, slot, pattern and recipe words?"
  governance
    applies [design-token, level, part, slot, pattern, recipe, convention, law, contract, check, case, agent, mandate, distribution]

@mandate design-base-system-stewardship
  meaning
    says "The bounded authority of design-base-system-steward over the design-base-system folder."
    answers "Which moves may design-base-system-steward make over the design-base-system folder?"
  governance
    requires "Claim no host permission or execution from this mandate; keep the public design base free of proprietary design rubrics, live Figma write tools and tenant corpora."
  authority
    participant @agent design-base-system-steward
    moves [Observation, Verification, Synthesis]
    covers [".ia/src/systems/design-base-system/"]
